{"articleNo":"43779","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=43779&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012 특허역량교육프로그램 설명회","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.03.19","hit":"4868","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span> <u><font color=\"#0900ff\">2012</font></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><u><font color=\"#0900ff\"> 특허역량교육프로그램 설명회</font></u></span></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;지식재산의 가치증대로 기업은 지식재산 경쟁력확보를 위하여 특허분야전략</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">수립이 가능한 융합형 지식재산인력을 필요로 하고 있습니다. </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp; &nbsp;이에 IP역량을 갖춘 우수한&nbsp;특허인재를 발굴하여 취업기회를 확대하고자&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">설명회를 개최하오니&nbsp;많은 학생들의 참여를 바랍니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">1. 일시 : 2012. 3. 22(목) 13:00~15:00</font></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. 장소 : 디지털관 시청각실 127호</span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 내용</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">가. 2012 캠퍼스특허전략유니버시아드 지원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 2012년도&nbsp;특허출원교육계획</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 특허출원교육, 특허출원지원사업, 특허관련시험안내, 기타 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; 4. 문의 : 산학협력단 7232</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            </span>"}
